          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Data Asset Loop:</strong> Designed a server-to-server authenticated API that hands off skin-analysis reports and skincare profiles with the session to WeChat AI advisors (session_id passthrough), turning one-off skin tests into continuously operable, repurchase-driving user data assets.
          </li>
        </ul>
